### 注册
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "123456"}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "123456"}

### 获取学生列表（把 TOKEN 替换为登录返回的 access_token）
GET http://localhost:8001/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzgxMjY2MTQ2fQ.NHuJwjG7CcsU0UgIxgtPAtoc9EGigLtlaZM7C63y9mo
